wɛ́kɛ kũ n kɛ̀ sí pínki.","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"Má dↄ̃ sà kũ Dikiri dì kína kũ à à kà sura ba,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"àdi yã sí kãao zaa a bɛ kũ à kú adona,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"àdi tó à zĩ̀ ble kũ a gã̀sã gbãnao.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Gbɛ̃kenↄ dì sↄ̃gonↄ náani kɛ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"gbɛ̃kenↄ dì sↄ̃nↄ náani kɛ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ókↄ̃nↄ sↄ̃, Dikiri ó Ludan odì náani kɛ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Oni sata ò lɛ́tɛ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ókↄ̃nↄ sↄ̃ ónigↄ̃ zɛna gíngin.","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"Dikiri, ǹ tó kína zĩ̀ ble.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Tó o n sisi, ǹ wewá.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/bqp_sim/PSA/20.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/bqp_sim/PSA/21.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/bqp_sim/PSA/19.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":9}